window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v26-091-5a3f74a2327134a4.json"]={sha256:"5a3f74a2327134a4cc7407fe134f0e0657057b24cd6ec0f8e12a9c70ff3d80c5",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-1e2a86d5fe73c9e1","url":"https://timesketch.org/guides/user/basic-concepts/","title":"Timesketch basic concepts","titleEn":"Timesketch basic concepts","publisher":"Timesketch","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-091","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-091","related":[{"id":"security-v26-092","referenceUrls":["https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/86/final"],"title":"NIST鑑識流程：雜湊與保管鏈完整性","titleEn":"NIST forensic process: hashes and chain-of-custody completeness","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付18項主張證據表、可重跑搜尋、來源去重理由與修訂後故事。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver eighteen claim-evidence rows, repeatable searches, source-deduplication rationale and a revised narrative.","difference":"記錄來源、取得時間、操作者、工具、雜湊及每次交接；保留原件與工作副本的關係。","differenceEn":"Record source, acquisition time, operator, tool, digest and every handoff, linking originals to working copies.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["有佐證主張率=至少有獨立佐證的主張/所有主張；事件多不一定代表獨立來源多。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 合成故事有18個主張，12個有獨立佐證，3個被證據反駁，3個仍未知。 有佐證主張率12/18=66.6667%；反駁與未知合計6項不能寫成確定事實。","保管鏈完整率=必要欄位齊全的交接/預期交接；雜湊只能支持位元一致，不能證明來源敘述真實。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 12個合成證據檔各需3次交接，共36筆；34筆有完整雙方、時間與雜湊紀錄。 完整率34/36=94.4444%；兩筆缺項仍必須列為限制。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Corroborated-claim rate counts claims with independent support; many events do not necessarily mean many independent sources. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. A synthetic narrative has eighteen claims: twelve independently supported, three contradicted and three unresolved. Corroborated-claim rate=66.6667%; the six contradicted or unresolved claims cannot be stated as facts.","Custody completeness counts fully documented required handoffs; hashes support byte equality, not the truth of origin claims. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. Twelve synthetic evidence files require three handoffs each, thirty-six total; thirty-four include complete parties, time and digest. Completeness=34/36=94.4444%; disclose the two incomplete handoffs as limitations.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v26-001","referenceUrls":["https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/207/final"],"title":"NIST 零信任架構：每次請求的政策決策與執行","titleEn":"NIST zero trust: per-request policy decisions and enforcement","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付18項主張證據表、可重跑搜尋、來源去重理由與修訂後故事。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver eighteen claim-evidence rows, repeatable searches, source-deduplication rationale and a revised narrative.","difference":"畫出學院成績服務的學徒、裝置、政策引擎與執行點；列角色通過、裝置合格、工作階段有效三項 AND 條件，逐一推演八列真值表。","differenceEn":"Map learner, device, policy engine and enforcement point for a grade service; enumerate the eight truth-table rows for role, device posture and session validity joined by AND.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["有佐證主張率=至少有獨立佐證的主張/所有主張；事件多不一定代表獨立來源多。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 合成故事有18個主張，12個有獨立佐證，3個被證據反駁，3個仍未知。 有佐證主張率12/18=66.6667%；反駁與未知合計6項不能寫成確定事實。","只要必要條件之一不成立便拒絕；聯集計數需扣除同時失敗者，不能把重複拒絕算成額外使用者。 合成的100次請求皆在有效時段；12次角色不符、8次裝置不符，其中3次同時不符。 拒絕12+8−3=17次，允許100−17=83次；裝置不符改15、重疊改5時，允許78次。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Corroborated-claim rate counts claims with independent support; many events do not necessarily mean many independent sources. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. A synthetic narrative has eighteen claims: twelve independently supported, three contradicted and three unresolved. Corroborated-claim rate=66.6667%; the six contradicted or unresolved claims cannot be stated as facts.","Deny when any required condition fails; union counts subtract overlapping failures rather than treating duplicate denials as additional people. In 100 synthetic in-window requests, 12 fail role, 8 fail device posture, and 3 fail both. Deny 12+8−3=17 and allow 83; with 15 device failures and overlap 5, allow 78.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-a525fecba1e01b54","url":"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/86/final","title":"NIST SP 800-86: forensic techniques in incident response","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-86: forensic techniques in incident response","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-ecea8146f24becc5","url":"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/207/final","title":"NIST SP 800-207: Zero Trust Architecture","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-207: Zero Trust Architecture","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
